   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "«Il faut» + infinitive",
     "texto": [
      "**Il faut** (you have to) is followed by an infinitive. It does not change with the person: **Il faut partir** (you have to leave).",
      "To say that something must not be done: **Il ne faut pas** + infinitive: **Il ne faut pas fumer ici** (you must not smoke here)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "«Devoir» + infinitive",
     "texto": [
      "**Devoir** (must, to have to) changes with the person: **je dois** (I must), **tu dois** (you must), **il doit** (he must), **nous devons** (we must).",
      "It is followed by an infinitive: **Nous devons payer** (we have to pay)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
